name: Repository preparation needs funding and separate execution consent
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/repository_allowance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: options taint-iris-next:codeql-db
require-live-snap: 25 Experimental | experimental-preparation
expect: preparation for the whole
expect: bound target.
expect: Context allowance
expect: repository-execution
expect: consent.
expect: No Map or Scan completion.
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/unfunded-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 needs an approved investigation allowance | unfunded-preparation
resize: 160x48
live-snap: unfunded-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: unfunded-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: unfunded-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: unfunded-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: unfunded-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: unfunded-reading-40x12
ask: Can the operator understand that execution consent alone does not fund preparation, including at narrow sizes, without interpreting the refusal as a completed Map or Scan?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/unapproved-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 requires explicit operator authorization | unapproved-preparation
resize: 160x48
live-snap: unapproved-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: unapproved-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: unapproved-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: unapproved-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: unapproved-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: unapproved-reading-40x12
ask: Does the second refusal explain that available allowance does not grant permission to run a repository build, without offering an automatic retry?
resize: 120x36
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/allowance-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 0/2 | unchanged-allowance
expect: protected review remaining: 1
expect: Calls available for context, scopes, scans and lessons: 1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/repository_allowance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unchanged
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/unfunded-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 needs an approved investigation allowance | restarted-unfunded
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/unapproved-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 requires explicit operator authorization | restarted-unapproved
resize: 40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: restarted-reading-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/repository_allowance.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve both refusals and untouched capacity, with no database, target execution, new job or provider request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
